Thanks for trying to help, Roger, but I was not hungry at the time.
I was informed via email that those numbers in parentheses after the
spell are not the number of points the spell uses; various sages have
it that one must either square the number or multiply it by three in
order to find how many spell points the spell requires.  

I guess this is just yet another way in which "experience" with an
early version of Nethack can prove to be worse than no experience
at all.  But I do appreciate your taking time to post on my behalf.

